abstract: >-
  Unofficial Japanese localization and extension of AgentDojo, the prompt-injection
  benchmark for LLM agents: Japanese tasks and injections for all four suites (97 user
  tasks, 31 injection tasks) and Japan-specific attack variants. Derived from AgentDojo (ETH
  Zurich SPy Lab; MIT License).
